# The setup screen names the token command and the HTTPS requirement before
# anything has failed, and the address field takes typed input.
wait-for Home Panel
expect kobo connect homepanel
expect must be on HTTPS
clean
shot homepanel-setup
tap Check again
wait-for No address has arrived
clean
shot homepanel-check-again
tap-id home-url
wait-for Home Assistant address
type homeassistant
expect https://homeassistant
clean
shot homepanel-typed
